#. USD coordinate orientation heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:100.
msgid "Coordinate System Orientation"
msgstr "Koordinatsystemets orientering"

#. USD Y-up import conversion, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:102.
msgid ""
"If the imported USD is Y up, a rotation will be automatically applied to "
"root objects to convert to Blender's Z up orientation."
msgstr ""
"Om den importerade USD-scenen har Y som uppåtriktning roteras "
"rotobjekten automatiskt så att de får Blenders Z-uppåtriktning."

#. USD import options heading, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:107.
msgid "Import Options"
msgstr "Importalternativ"

#. USD camera import, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:158.
msgid ""
"Import ``UsdGeomCamera`` primitives as :doc:`Camera Objects "
"</render/cameras>`."
msgstr ""
"Importera ``UsdGeomCamera``-primitiver som :doc:`kameraobjekt "
"</render/cameras>`."

#. USD camera supported attributes introduction, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:160.
msgid "Supported camera attributes include:"
msgstr "Följande kameraattribut stöds:"

